{"2241760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MotorCubs RC", "steam_appid": 2241760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.poster.avif?t=1776785618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.webm?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.mp4?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rev Up</strong> for teddy bear-fueled mayhem in the badlands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MotorCubs RC, the cutest crash-test dummies on wheels are here to shred <strong>Monument Valley’s</strong> iconic red-rock wilderness. Strap adorable teddy bears into four wild RC vehicle classes — nimble Compact, lightning-fast Sport, mud-chewing Mud Plugger, and the absolute beast <strong>Titan</strong> — and launch them into 10 savage <strong>offroad tracks</strong> where every boulder, bush, and flaming wreck is out to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger rides crush bigger obstacles, but only the sharpest drivers (and luckiest bears) will <strong>survive</strong> the jumps, rockslides, and spectacular wipeouts. Feel the <strong>physics-driven thrill</strong> as your RC machine flips, bounces, and powers through interactive hazards and <strong>unforgiving</strong> terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.poster.avif?t=1776785618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.webm?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.mp4?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race <strong>Solo</strong> against the clock or grab a friend for <strong>Local Co-Op</strong> chaos — because nothing says “teamwork” like two teddy bears trading paint at full throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more tracks and events roaring down the pipeline, MotorCubs RC delivers pure, unfiltered offroad adrenaline wrapped in the world’s most huggable racers. Are you tough enough to keep your bear alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Valley. <strong>Wreck everything else.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.poster.avif?t=1776785618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.webm?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/87aa466b65d9729881700182c4565af2.mp4?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rev Up</strong> for teddy bear-fueled mayhem in the badlands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In MotorCubs RC, the cutest crash-test dummies on wheels are here to shred <strong>Monument Valley’s</strong> iconic red-rock wilderness. Strap adorable teddy bears into four wild RC vehicle classes — nimble Compact, lightning-fast Sport, mud-chewing Mud Plugger, and the absolute beast <strong>Titan</strong> — and launch them into 10 savage <strong>offroad tracks</strong> where every boulder, bush, and flaming wreck is out to end your run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bigger rides crush bigger obstacles, but only the sharpest drivers (and luckiest bears) will <strong>survive</strong> the jumps, rockslides, and spectacular wipeouts. Feel the <strong>physics-driven thrill</strong> as your RC machine flips, bounces, and powers through interactive hazards and <strong>unforgiving</strong> terrain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.poster.avif?t=1776785618\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.webm?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2241760/extras/1bc9bc370cf687af43c15b66b7d3d1aa.mp4?t=1776785618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race <strong>Solo</strong> against the clock or grab a friend for <strong>Local Co-Op</strong> chaos — because nothing says “teamwork” like two teddy bears trading paint at full throttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With more tracks and events roaring down the pipeline, MotorCubs RC delivers pure, unfiltered offroad adrenaline wrapped in the world’s most huggable racers. Are you tough enough to keep your bear alive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the Valley. <strong>Wreck everyt